{"answer": 1, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span> 그래프에서 두 극한을 읽는다</div>\n    $$\n    \\lim_{x\\to0-}f(x)=-1,\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to1+}f(x)=2.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> 더한다</div>\n    $$\n    (-1)+2=1.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;①</div>\n"}